@startuml
title 小組加入、即時作答檢視與學習單匯入 - Domain Model
class Activity {
  activityId
  phase: preparing / answering / ended
  joiningOpenedAt: nullable timestamp
  activityLiveRevision
}
class WorksheetQuestion {
  rowId
  sourceQuestionNumber: question_number
  displayOrder: display_order
  sourceSheet
  sourceRow
}
class AnswerMapping {
  slotIndex: zero-based contiguous
  sourceCellOrRange
}
class Team {
  groupId
  displayName
  onlineCount
  joinState: unavailable / open / full / stopped
  groupLiveRevision
}
class MemberSession {
  sessionId
  role: leader / member
  connectionState: online / disconnected
  disconnectedAt
}
class TeamAnswer {
  sourceQuestionNumber
  status: unanswered / valid submission
  answerParts
  currentRank
}
class QuestionProgress {
  sourceQuestionNumber
  answeredGroupCount
  totalGroupCount
  answeredAndUnansweredGroups
}
Activity "1" o-- "0..*" WorksheetQuestion
WorksheetQuestion "1" o-- "1..*" AnswerMapping
Activity "1" o-- "0..*" Team
Team "1" o-- "0..2" MemberSession
WorksheetQuestion "1" o-- "0..*" TeamAnswer
Team "1" o-- "0..*" TeamAnswer
Activity "1" o-- "1..*" QuestionProgress
note right of Activity
  Keep only three lifecycle phases.
  During preparing, the teacher may edit/import
  until explicitly opening joining.
  Open action validates readiness and atomically
  sets joiningOpenedAt and freezes the question set.
  Migration 009 backfills that marker for preparing
  activities only when membership and question readiness exist.
  Incomplete legacy sets stay editable with joining closed.
  The activity remains preparing; student team view
  retains its existing presentation.
  Answering: no new join, existing reconnect unlimited.
  Ended: participation stops; authorized results remain.
end note
note right of WorksheetQuestion
  Preserve worksheet order and source number.
  Gaps are valid; a missing/duplicate number on a
  question row rejects the complete import.
  New imports persist document order; migration 009
  backfills legacy order by ascending source number.
  Question number remains the answer/mapping business key.
  Mapping slot index is independent of source number.
end note
note right of MemberSession
  Clean close: offline immediately.
  Unclean drop: 30s without heartbeat.
  Team phase releases online vacancy; association retained.
  Legacy disconnected_until maps to disconnectedAt
  using the stored updatedAt timestamp.
  Answering retains membership without expiry.
end note
note right of Team
  Team formation after joining opens: open with a vacancy,
  full at two online members. Offline transition can reopen it.
  The teacher roster exposes onlineCount, not capacity fields.
end note
note right of QuestionProgress
  Denominator includes offline groups.
  Valid first submissions rank by feature 004 order.
  Question lists and result displays follow displayOrder.
  Active student view is own-team only.
end note
@enduml
